  "id": "runtime-limits-interpolated-output-default",
  "description": "Plan v7 section 8.3: maximumInterpolatedOutputCharacters at its DEFAULT of 262,144 (256 * 1_024), pinned from both sides with no override. A nineteen-level doubling chain from a one-character leaf yields exactly 2^18 = 262,144 characters at d1; the second key appends a single literal X after the same chain to produce 262,145. Cumulative expansion for either key is 2^19 - 1 = 524,287, half the 1,048,576 default budget, and the deepest recursion is 19, inside the default depth of 32 — so the per-output cap and nothing else is what decides these two keys.",
